    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ultimate How-to-Socialize video game for introverts!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social Caterpillar is a game about an introvert who exercises their social skills like a muscle. Social interactions are framed as puzzles that need solved. The more you solve, the more energy you have to venture further from home. Explore a sequence of nuanced dioramas about the small hurdles of social anxiety!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve people like puzzles!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a myriad of puzzles, each with its own internal logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the order you want to tackle each interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logical abstractions require you to think and test</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Increase your Social Energy!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up with each successful puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the energy and tools to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secret areas and extra hidden layers</p></li></ul>",
